{"publicId":"474cd196-6cc9-49bc-9047-9135a23c2920","title":"Zura Bio宣布治疗严重皮肤疾病Phase 2试验失败致股价大跌","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-09T13:44:28.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-09T13:44:28.000Z","digest":"Zura Bio在2026年11月9日宣布其治疗严重皮肤疾病的Phase 2临床试验失败，导致公司股价单日下跌约15%。该试验旨在评估ZUR-0201药物在缓解患者症状和改善皮肤愈合方面的效果，但未达到预设的主要终点指标。目前尚无公开数据披露具体失败原因或后续计划，投资者对该公司研发管线稳定性产生担忧。\n\n该事件直接影响Zura Bio市值约3.2亿美元，且可能延缓其与礼来制药的潜在合作。早前有分析机构预测该药物2027年上市概率为62%，此次失败将重新评估市场预期。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-10T16:38:50.210Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Zura Bio 公布 Phase 2 临床试验失败","latestReport":{"id":"oqujwi7umbwde4n0r0azeez1i"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fB1QkI5Nhtso","title":"Zura报告了在难治性皮肤疾病中的2期失败","firstReportAt":"2026-11-09T13:44:28.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"oqujwi7umbwde4n0r0azeez1i","title":"Zura Bio 公布 Phase 2 临床试验失败","summary":"Zura Bio 报告其在治疗一种严重皮肤疾病的 Phase 2 试验中失败，公司股价大幅下跌。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T13:44:28.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"oqujwi7umbwde4n0r0azeez1i","title":"Zura Bio 公布 Phase 2 临床试验失败","summary":"Zura Bio 报告其在治疗一种严重皮肤疾病的 Phase 2 试验中失败，公司股价大幅下跌。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T13:44:28.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-10T17:00:00.000Z","heat":4.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","heat":4.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T19:00:00.000Z","heat":4.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T21:00:00.000Z","heat":4.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T22:00:00.000Z","heat":3.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T23:00:00.000Z","heat":3.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z","heat":3.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T02:00:00.000Z","heat":3.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T03:00:00.000Z","heat":3.4,"par